    ["令目标小队成员获得<HighLight>读心标记</>，持续*f秒。观众同一时间只能令一位目标获得<HighLight>读心标记</>，且目标同一时间只能获得一位观众的<HighLight>读心标记</>。<HighLight>读心标记</>的持有者与施法者之间的距离超过70米时，持有者将失去<HighLight>读心标记</>。\n仅<HighLight>空想姿态</>可用，<HighLight>噩梦姿态</>下切换为<HighLight>狂乱</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>读心标记</>：持有者生命低于30%时，获得持续*f秒的buffdisc(*id)，此效果存在20秒冷却。当标记的施法者使用战斗技能造成治疗效果时，标记的持有者回复效果量30%的生命（受目标减疗影响）。"] = "Causes a target party member to gain a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</>, lasting for *f seconds. A Зритель can only have one target with a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> at a time, and a target can only have a <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> from one Зритель at a time. If the distance between the holder of the <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</> and the caster exceeds 70 meters, the holder will lose the <HighLight>Mind Reading Mark</>. \nOnly available in <HighLight>Стойка фантазии</>; switches to <HighLight>Frenzy</> under <HighLight>Стойка кошмара</>. \n\n<FaintYellow>Mind Reading Mark</>: When the holder's Health drops below 30%, they gain, for *f seconds, buffdisc(*id); this effect has a 20-second Перезарядка. When the caster of the mark uses a Боевой навык to perform Healing, the holder of the mark recovers Health equal to 30% of the healing amount (affected by the target's Healing Reduction).",
